# Files graphify leaves out of the knowledge graph (gitignore syntax).
# .gitignore is read first; this file only adds exclusions.
# Rule: the graph shows the project's source code, plus files the code reads
# at runtime (prompts/, bootstrap/cast.md, config). Documentation, content
# managed outside this project and tool state stay out.

# Claude Code skills (third-party, plus this project's experiments workflow)
# and Claude Code's own settings.
.claude/skills/
.claude/settings.json

# Series media: character portraits, bootstrap sprites, voice samples.
# By extension, so the card metadata (pin.json) the code reads stays in.
data/series/**/*.png
data/series/**/*.wav

# Bundled Noto fonts and their license (SIL OFL).
app/fonts/
data/series/*/fonts/

# Documentation: the spec, the project guide, the README, the cast template.
.claude/rules/
CLAUDE.md
README.md
data/series/*/bootstrap/cast.example.md

# Exclude knowledge_vault from being presented in the graph.
knowledge_vault
